<section class="admin-page-head"><div><p class="admin-kicker">M11 · MEDIOS</p><h1><?= e(match($kind){'evidence'=>'Fotografías de la operación','invoice'=>'Comprobantes privados','product'=>'Galería y fichas del producto',default=>'Biblioteca pública'}) ?></h1><p>JPEG, PNG o WebP reales, hasta 10 MiB. Se guardan copias WebP sin metadatos. Los originales no se conservan.</p></div></section>
<?php if($canUpload):?><form class="admin-panel admin-form" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/admin/media/upload" data-no-admin-fetch><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="<?= e($csrf) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="<?= e($kind) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="parent_id" value="<?= e($parent) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="operation_key" value="<?= e(bin2hex(random_bytes(24))) ?>"><div class="admin-form-grid"><label class="admin-field"><span>Imagen autorizada</span><input name="image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required <?= $kind==='evidence'?'capture="environment"':'' ?>></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Texto alternativo / descripción</span><input name="alt_text" maxlength="250" required></label><?php if($kind==='product'):?><label class="admin-field"><span>Uso de la imagen</span><select name="media_role"><option value="gallery">Galería</option><option value="technical">Ficha técnica en imagen</option></select></label><?php endif?><?php if($kind==='evidence'):?><label class="admin-field"><span>Receptor (si corresponde)</span><input name="receiver" maxlength="120"></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Observaciones</span><textarea name="notes" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><?php endif?></div><p>Entre 64 y 8192 px por lado, hasta 12 megapíxeles y proporción de 1:8 a 8:1. Las evidencias no se sustituyen ni eliminan.</p><button class="admin-primary-button">Validar y adjuntar imagen</button></form><?php endif?>
<div class="cms-media-grid"><?php foreach($files as $f):?><article class="admin-panel"><a href="/admin/media/file?id=<?= e($f['media_id']) ?>"><img class="cms-preview" loading="lazy" src="/admin/media/file?id=<?= e($f['media_id']) ?>" alt="<?= e($f['alt_text']) ?>"></a><h2><?= e($f['alt_text']) ?></h2><p>ID <?= e($f['media_id']) ?> · <?= e($f['original_name']) ?></p><p><?= e($f['display_name']) ?> · <?= e($f['media_created_at']??$f['created_at']) ?> UTC</p><?php if(isset($f['receiver'])):?><p>Receptor: <?= e($f['receiver']) ?></p><p><?= e($f['notes']) ?></p><?php endif?><?php if($kind==='product'):?><p><?= e($f['media_role']) ?> · Orden <?= e($f['display_order']) ?><?= (int)$f['is_primary']?' · Principal':'' ?></p><?php if($canUpload):?><form method="post" action="/admin/media/arrange"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="<?= e($csrf) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="parent_id" value="<?= e($parent) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="expected_order" value="<?= e($f['display_order']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="image_id" value="<?= e($f['id']) ?>"><?php if($f['media_role']==='gallery'):?><button class="admin-secondary-button" name="action" value="primary">Usar como principal</button><?php endif?><button class="admin-secondary-button" name="action" value="up">Subir una posición</button></form><?php endif?><?php endif?></article><?php endforeach?></div><?php if(!$files):?><p class="admin-panel">Todavía no hay imágenes asociadas.</p><?php endif?>
